/steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680716","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4745300-1842846814442230","game_id":"steam-4745300","kind":"announcement","title":"New, Used, or Leased? Building a Fleet in Flightline","summary":"On the way through the terminal, Flynn stopped beside the window.One aircraft outside looked freshly painted. The one parked beside it did not.“Why would an airline buy the older one?” he asked.Lina kept walking. “Because the new one probably costs more.”“It also burns less fuel.”“And when can they have it?”Flynn looked again. “Good point.”“The older one might not belong to them anyway.”“What do you mean?”“It could be leased.”“So, new, used, or rented.”“Leased.”“That is a more expensive word for","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T04:52:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814442230","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4745300-1841579228669210","game_id":"steam-4745300","kind":"announcement","title":"What Does the Fare Include? Building the Passenger Product","summary":"Flynn selected the cheaper flight.“Four seats together?” Lina asked.“Seat selection costs extra.”“With two children, I’d rather know where everyone is sitting.”Flynn added the seats.“One checked bag is included,” he said. “The extra carry-ons aren’t.”“We can share two.”“Meal?”Lina checked the fare details. “Nothing included. They sell food onboard.”Flynn looked at the new total.“Still cheaper.”“Then keep going.”The fare may be the first number a passenger sees. The product decides what that fare","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T15:39:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228669210","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4745300-1840944183779853","game_id":"steam-4745300","kind":"announcement","title":"Same Aircraft, Different Cabin: How Airlines Use the Space Inside","summary":"A few months after their London trip, Flynn and Lina were comparing flights again.“This one uses the same kind of plane we took to London,” Flynn said.“Then why does it have another seat in every row?”Flynn leaned closer to the screen.“You’re right.”Lina switched between the seat maps.“The other flight has fewer seats, but it costs more.”“For the four of us, the cheaper one is still hard to ignore.”“I know,” Lina said. “I just want to know what we’re buying.”An aircraft model provides the availa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T14:41:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183779853","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4745300-1840310314344496","game_id":"steam-4745300","kind":"announcement","title":"Finding Your Passengers: What Creates Demand in Flightline","summary":"The flight home from Gatwick had been full.At JFK, Flynn and Lina joined another crowd. Families waited around luggage carts while business travelers hurried towards their connections.Flynn looked back.\"How many people fly between New York and London every day?\" \"Enough to fill our flight,\" Lina said. \"And all the others.\"An onward-connections screen listed another flight to Boston.\"Who flies from New York to Boston?\" Lina looked at him. \"People who don't want to spend hours on a train.\" \"After ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T10:00:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314344496","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4745300-1839676055887343","game_id":"steam-4745300","kind":"announcement","title":"One City, Many Airports: How Passengers Choose in Flightline","summary":"“JFK to Heathrow is the obvious one,” Lina said, turning the laptop towards Flynn.“Obvious for the flight, maybe. Your sister lives south of London.”“Fine. Then JFK to Gatwick.”“What about Newark? This one is cheaper.”Lina looked at him. “From Brooklyn? With two kids? We’d spend half the morning getting to the airport.”“What about LaGuardia? It’s closer.”“Not if we have to change in Boston.”They stared at the screen for a moment.“Okay,” Flynn said. “Start again.”We built Flightline’s demand syst","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T07:12:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055887343","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4745300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:02Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:02Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4745300":"2026-10-26T04:02:02Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4745300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:02Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:02Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5103340":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:02Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:02Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4745300","app_id":4745300,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:54Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"7974